@title Drawer toolbars: the strip edits and cable rows are in the drawers, not in Draw
@area Terminals
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Lane V4d (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). The 11 Terminal strips rows and the 4 Cables
# rows of the Draw menu moved to the toolbars of their drawers; Ctrl+3 opens the Terminals drawer,
# Ctrl+4 the Cables drawer. Every command still runs from Ctrl+K.
open qa/fixtures/text-stress-cabinet.novo
wait 20
click_text Draw #1
wait 6
shot draw-menu
expect_not "Terminal strips"
expect_not "Rename terminals (find and replace)"
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+3
wait 20
shot terminals-toolbar
expect "Add spare terminals"
expect "Rename terminals"
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text "rename terminals"
wait 8
shot palette-path
expect "Terminals drawer"
key Escape
